[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0010","text":"这个是……\n应该是夏叶姐的吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0020","text":"然后……这边是凛世小姐的……\n这是树里酱的，最后是千雪前辈的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0030","text":"——对吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0040","text":"哦哦，真厉害\n全对"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0050","text":"嘿嘿\n太好了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0060","text":"啊……那，最后剩下的这个是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0070","text":"嗯，没错\n是果穗的服装————果穗的新服装"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0080","text":"诶，诶！\n咦……不是干洗的吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0090","text":"哈哈，整人大成功……！\n还想让你试穿一下，可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900100_02_0100","text":"——！！\n好的，我想穿！"}]
